WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.362
Here's the whole pipeline on one slide.

2
00:00:02.362 --> 00:00:06.050
An H R extract comes in as a C S V file.

3
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:10.469
The middleware validates it, normalizes
it, orders it, batches it and

4
00:00:10.469 --> 00:00:15.125
paces the calls, then posts bulk
requests to the provisioning endpoint.

5
00:00:15.125 --> 00:00:17.175
Along the way it writes four files.

6
00:00:17.175 --> 00:00:22.200
Three of them carry only keys and hashes,
so they can live in the evidence store.

7
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.244
The quarantine file holds the
refused rows, real personal data,

8
00:00:26.244 --> 00:00:29.588
so it goes only to the
access-controlled audit store.

9
00:00:29.588 --> 00:00:33.740
Keep those four files in
mind; the labs read every one.
